ierarchy only for attachment\", \"justification_owner\": \"world-architect\"}\n{\"id\": \"L08\", \"pattern\": \"Hidden globals & singletons\", \"detection\": \"static instances initialized implicitly\", \"default_stance\": \"Service registry + init graph\", \"justification_owner\": \"core-runtime-architect\"}\n{\"id\": \"L09\", \"pattern\": \"Process-global mutable cvars read anywhere\", \"detection\": \"cvar reads inside parallel tasks\", \"default_stance\": \"Immutable config snapshots latched at sync points\", \"justification_owner\": \"core-runtime-architect\"}\n{\"id\": \"L10\", \"pattern\": \"Hot-path virtual dispatch across contracts\", \"detection\": \"virtual call per draw/body/query\", \"default_stance\": \"Batch-granular interfaces; binding at build/load time\", \"justification_owner\": \"engine-architect\"}\n{\"id\": \"L11\", \"pattern\": \"Coarse locks & global renderer sync\", \"detection\": \"mutex around a subsystem; renderer-wide flush\", \"default_stance\": \"Declared access, channels, lock-free where justified\", \"justification_owner\": \"concurrency-primitives\"}\n{\"id\": \"L12\", \"pattern\": \"Draw-call-centric CPU submission on capable tiers\", \"detection\": \"one CPU draw per object on desktop/console\", \"default_stance\": \"GPU-driven on capable tiers; CPU-batched on TBDR/lite3d by ADR\", \"justification_owner\": \"render-architect\"}\n{\"id\": \"L13\", \"pattern\": \"DX11/OpenGL binding & sync assumptions\", \"detection\": \"slot binding, immediate context, driver-managed hazards\", \"default_stance\": \"Binding tiers + render-graph-derived barriers\", \"justification_owner\": \"rhi-core\"}\n{\"id\": \"L14\", \"pattern\": \"Per-object render proxy mirror\", \"detection\": \"proxy objects created/synced per object per frame\", \"default_stance\": \"Change-tracked delta extraction, O(changes)\", \"justification_owner\": \"render-architect\"}\n{\"id\": \"L15\", \"pattern\": \"Frame-tied resource lifetimes\", \"detection\": \"resources freed at end of frame/level\", \"default_stance\": \"Explicit lifetimes + retirement keyed to completion tokens\", \"justification_owner\": \"resource-streaming-architect\"}\n{\"id\": \"L16\", \"pattern\": \"Synchronous IO / blocking loads\", \"detection\": \"file read on a frame-critical thread\", \"default_stance\": \"Async staged pipeline with deadlines\", \"justification_owner\": \"async-io-storage\"}\n{\"id\": \"L17\", \"pattern\": \"Page-fault-driven streaming\", \"detection\": \"mmap reads on latency-critical workers\", \"default_stance\": \"Explicit IO requests; mmap only prefetched/tool-side\", \"justification_owner\": \"async-io-storage\"}\n{\"id\": \"L18\", \"pattern\": \"Level-as-a-file loading\", \"detection\": \"whole level loaded before play\", \"default_stance\": \"Cell streaming with budgeted activation\", \"justification_owner\": \"world-architect\"}\n{\"id\": \"L19\", \"pattern\": \"Immediate synchronous observer callbacks across subsystems\", \"detection\": \"callbacks invoked on the producer's thread mid-update\", \"default_stance\": \"Deferred batched events at declared consumption points\", \"justification_owner\": \"entity-object-model\"}\n{\"id\": \"L20\", \"pattern\": \"Stringly-typed reflection on runtime paths\", \"detection\": \"name lookups per frame\", \"default_stance\": \"Static reflection & resolved IDs; strings at tool/script boundaries\", \"justification_owner\": \"reflection-metadata\"}\n{\"id\": \"L21\", \"pattern\": \"Tracing-GC-managed engine objects\", \"detection\": \"engine objects reachable via GC\", \"default_stance\": \"Explicit ownership + generational handles; weak script refs\", \"justification_owner\": \"entity-object-model\"}\n{\"id\": \"L22\", \"pattern\": \"Global script VM on one thread\", \"detection\": \"single interpreter mutating the world\", \"default_stance\": \"Per-worker VMs/isolates, deferred mutation\", \"justification_owner\": \"scripting-runtime\"}\n{\"id\": \"L23\", \"pattern\": \"Editor-in-runtime monolith\", \"detection\": \"editor code linked into shipping builds\", \"default_stance\": \"Tool-side modules; tools target only\", \"justification_owner\": \"editor-architect\"}\n{\"id\": \"L24\", \"pattern\": \"Blocking cook-before-play\", \"detection\": \"full cook required before running\", \"default_stance\": \"On-demand cooking & cook-server streaming\", \"justification_owner\": \"content-pipeline-architect\"}\n{\"id\": \"L25\", \"pattern\": \"Single-thread-first design\", \"detection\": \"systems that must run serially by construction\", \"default_stance\": \"Parallel by default; serial exceptions enumerated\", \"justification_owner\": \"architecture-governance\"}\n{\"id\": \"L26\", \"pattern\": \"Monolithic subsystems\", \"detection\": \"one module owning a whole domain\", \"default_stance\": \"Contracts + focused experts\", \"justification_owner\": \"engine-architect\"}\n{\"id\": \"L27\", \"pattern\": \"ECS for everything / GPU-driven everywhere (new dogma)\", \"detection\": \"technique applied where access patterns do not fit\", \"default_stance\": \"Per-domain ADR with workload evidence\", \"justification_owner\": \"architecture-governance\"}\n['_doc', 'patterns']","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"65b55475-8795-41b4-bcb2-34a570ccfd13","timestamp":"2026-09-29T16:21:07.052Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"36a4c57f-0927-49bb-98f0-707ffd4f52c4","userType":"external","entrypoint":"remote_mobile","cwd":"/home/user/skills","sessionId":"64f15158-6a4e-5bdf-8a90-7f2bd7b05b82","version":"2.1.284","gitBranch":"claude/engine-skill-framework-phase1"}
